"key":"røgindhenrikpau","last":"Røgind","name":"Røgind, Henrik","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Annette","key":"hansenannbritegpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"29b6e1f5-8374-4247-a7bd-76de887cc30d","name":"Hansen, Ann-Brit Eg","name_org":"Hansen, Annette","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jesper","key":"nørregaardjesperpau","last":"Nørregaard","name":"Nørregaard, Jesper","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Søren","key":"jacobsensørenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"2e4e0e73-2c03-4ba5-9956-e84d75506240","name":"Jacobsen, Søren","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Dorte V.","key":"jensendortevpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Dorte V.","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Natalia","key":"manilonataliapau","last":"Manilo","name":"Manilo, Natalia","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Karsten","key":"asmussenkarstenpau","last":"Asmussen","locid":"6112a9d9-4b55-42d5-a5c3-01d242d8f4fc","name":"Asmussen, Karsten","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mikael","key":"boesenmikaelpau","last":"Boesen","locid":"b449f652-d441-4b23-836f-2d5111ef64dd","name":"Boesen, Mikael","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Zoreh","key":"rastiemadabadizorehpau","last":"Rastiemadabadi","name":"Rastiemadabadi, Zoreh","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lone","key":"morselcarlsenlonepau","last":"Morsel-Carlsen","name":"Morsel-Carlsen, Lone","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jakob Møllenbach","key":"møllerjakobmøllenbachpau","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, Jakob Møllenbach","rank":24,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","first":"Niels Steen","key":"kroghnielssteenpau","last":"Krogh","name":"Krogh, Niels Steen","rank":25,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Merete Lund","key":"hetlandmeretelundpau","last":"Hetland","locid":"3407b4a7-174d-43db-bae6-74e7f035a81f","name":"Hetland, Merete Lund","rank":26,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36549857"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/rmdopen-2022-002796","issn":["20565933"],"issue":"2","journal":"RMD Open","status":"p","title":"RMD Open","volume":"8"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85144568565"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Private Research","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Other Companies","Other Hospitals","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen","capio privathospital","zitelab aps"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-51c2b1f6-6eec-41d4-814e-8c17812bf126"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Flare during tapering of biological DMARDs in patients with rheumatoid arthritis in routine care : characteristics and predictors","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-442269","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Objective: To assess the ability of ultrasound to predict successful tapering and successful discontinuation of biological DMARDs (bDMARDs) at the 2-year follow-up in RA patients in sustained remission. Methods: Patients in sustained remission (DAS28-CRP ≤ 2.6) and with no radiographic progression the previous year tapered bDMARDs according to a standardized regime. A total of 119 of these patients were included in this ultrasound substudy. At baseline, clinical assessment, MRI, X-ray and ultrasound of 24 joints were performed. Ultrasound-detected synovitis was defined and scored 0-3 using the OMERACT scoring system at the joint level for both grey-scale and Doppler activity. Sum scores for each ultrasound modality were calculated for 24 joints at the patient level. The final state of treatment was assessed after 2 years. The predictive value of ultrasound measures for successful tapering and discontinuation at the 2-year follow-up was assessed via logistic regression analyses. Results: Negative IgM-RF [odds ratio (OR) = 0.29, 95% CI: 0.10-0.85; P = 0.024] and lower Doppler sum score of 24 joints (OR = 0.44, 95% CI: 0.15, 0.87; P = 0.014) were independent predictors for successful discontinuation of bDMARDs at the 2-year follow-up. The predictive value of the Doppler sum score was independent of MRI findings. Previous numbers of bDMARDs were predictive of successful tapering (OR = 0.58, 95% CI: 0.35, 0.91; P = 0.018), whereas ultrasound was not. Clinical parameters were not predictive of successful tapering/discontinuation. Conclusion: Doppler sum score was an independent predictor for successful discontinuation of bDMARDs at the 2-year follow-up - the odds for achieving successful discontinuation decreased by 56% per one-unit increase in Doppler sum score. Ultrasound could not predict successful tapering.","author_count":26,"contributors":["Terslev, Lene","Brahe, Cecilie Heegaard","Hetland, Merete Lund","Georgiadis, Stylianos","Ellegaard, Karen","Juul, Lars","Huynh, Tuan","Døhn, Uffe Møller","Fana, Viktoria","Møller, Torsten","Krabbe, Simon","Ørnbjerg, Lykke Midtbøll","Glinatsi, Daniel","Røgind, Henrik","Hansen, Anette","Nørregaard, Jesper","Jacobsen, Søren","Jensen, Dorte Vendelbo","Manilo, Natalia","Asmussen, Karsten","Boesen, Mikael","Rastiemadabadi, Zoreh","Morsel-Carlsen, Lone","Møller, Jakob Møllenbach","Krogh, Niels Steen","Østergaard, Mikkel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-479196"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Clinical remission","Discontinuation","Doppler","Tapering","Ultrasound","bDMARD"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"doppler ultrasound predicts successful discontinuation of biological dmards in rheumatoid arthritis patients in clinical remission","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-479196","identifier":[{"id":"33748831","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85122435453","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-8f7c1eb8-79c1-4a8d-8b01-486eddfca267"],"keyword":["Doppler","T2T strategy","bDMARD","clinical remission","discontinuation","synovial hypertrophy","tapering","ultrasound","ultrasound remission"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-275FD48F6EABD45EEF7C7AE20170ADC3"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Uni