"scoID":["2-s2.0-85120508253"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","North Denmark Region","Other Hospitals","Other Research","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark","prehospital emergency medical services"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-b1503f12-e5c3-46c7-ad7f-6ad66f9318ee","au-f7cf8ab9-289b-42bd-a5d9-1591b7f15fe7","ku-0e674c0b-7d3c-4842-9e13-dee8524a191d","sdu-fcbff8b2-4b83-4951-9013-3382acc559e5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Waking Up in Pain : a prospective unselected cohort study of pain in 3702 patients immediately after surgery in the Danish Realm","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-099.89-008547","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"To investigate TNF inhibitor (TNFi) retention and response rates in European biologic-naïve patients with PsA. Methods: Prospectively collected data on PsA patients in routine care from 12 European registries were pooled. Heterogeneity in baseline characteristics between registries were explored (analysis of variance and pairwise comparison). Retention rates (Kaplan-Meier), clinical remission [28-joint count DAS (DAS28) <2.6; 28 joint Disease Activity index for Psoriatic Arthritis ≤4] and ACR criteria for 20% improvement (ACR20)/ACR50/ACR70 were calculated, including LUNDEX adjustment. Results: Overall, 14 261 patients with PsA initiated a first TNFi. Considerable heterogeneity of baseline characteristics between registries was observed. The median 12-month retention rate (95% CI) was 77% (76, 78%), ranging from 68 to 90% across registries. Overall, DAS28/28 joint Disease Activity index for Psoriatic Arthritis remission rates at 6 months were 56%/27% (LUNDEX: 45%/22%). Six-month ACR20/50/70 responses were 53%/38%/22%, respectively. In patients initiating a first TNFi after 2009 with registered fulfilment of ClASsification for Psoriatic ARthritis (CASPAR) criteria (n = 1980) or registered one or more swollen joint at baseline (n = 5803), the retention rates and response rates were similar to those found overall. Conclusion: Approximately half of >14 000 patients with PsA who initiated first TNFi treatment in routine care were in DAS28 remission after 6 months, and three-quarters were still on the drug after 1 year. Considerable heterogeneity in baseline characteristics and outcomes across registries was observed. The feasibility of creating a large European database of PsA patients treated in routine care was demonstrated, offering unique opportunities for research with real-world data.","author_count":32,"contributors":["Brahe, Cecilie Heegaard","Ørnbjerg, Lykke Midtbøll","Jacobsson, Lennart","Nissen, Michael J.","Kristianslund, Eirik Klami","Mann, Herman","Santos, Maria José","Reino, Juan Gómez","Nordström, Dan","Rotar, Ziga","Gudbjornsson, Bjorn","Onen, Fatos","Codreanu, Catalin","Lindström, Ulf","Möller, Burkhard","Kvien, Tore K.","Pavelka, Karel","Barcelos, Anabela","Sánchez-Piedra, Carlos","Eklund, Kari K.","Tomšič, Matija","Love, Thorvardur Jon","Can, Gercek","Ionescu, Ruxandra","Loft, Anne Gitte","Van Der Horst-Bruinsma, I. E.","MacFarlane, Gary J.","Iannone, Florenzo","Hyldstrup, Lise Hejl","Krogh, Niels Steen","Østergaard, Mikkel","Hetland, Merete Lund"],"cuid":["S02-094.12-027701"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Brahe, Cecilie Heegaard"],"country":["Czechia","Finland","Iceland","Italy","Netherlands","Norway","Portugal","Romania","Slovenia","Spain","Sweden","Switzerland","Turkey","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["Academic Medical Centre","All Global Affiliations","Carol Davila University of Medicine and Pharmacy","Charles University","Diakonhjemmet Hospital","Dokuz Eylul University","Landspitali University Hospital","Spanish Society of Rheumatology","University of Aberdeen","University of Amsterdam","University of Aveiro","University of Bari","University of Bern","University of Geneva","University of Gothenburg","University of Helsinki","University of Iceland","University of Lisbon","University of Ljubljana","VU University Amsterdam","Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam"],"keyword":["DAPSA28","DAS28","Drug survival","Effectiveness","Epidemiology","Psoriatic arthritis","Register","Response","Spondyloarthritis","TNFi"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"retention and response rates in 000000000014 000000000261 psa patients starting tnf inhibitor treatment results from 000000000012 countries in eurospa","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85084200183","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-094.12-027701","identifier":[{"id":"85084200183","type":"scopus"},{"id":"31665497","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-cf2177b6-52a5-4102-b8e0-d7cd4107a888","ku-29bfbf0f-88a9-4513-8ab0-2eedcf4b6f42"],"keyword":["DAPSA28","DAS28","TNFi","drug survival","effectiveness","epidemiology","psoriatic arthritis","register","response","spondyloarthritis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F88A29CDA0991B4AE62C3D99A515DC88"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"university of gothenburg","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Gothenburg","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ch","key":"university of geneva","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Geneva","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"no","key":"diakonhjemmet hospital","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Diakonhjemmet Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"cz","key":"charles university","loc":["Czechia","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Charles University","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"pt","key":"university of lisbon","loc":["Portugal","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Univers